---
/**
 * Reusable resource cards: article, short video, and talk.
 * Used on the homepage (Resources section) and blog page (Start Here section).
 */
---

<div class="flex gap-6 overflow-x-auto snap-x snap-mandatory scroll-smooth pb-4 -mx-4 px-4 md:px-0 md:mx-0 scrollbar-hide">
  <!-- 1. Blog: What is VSM? -->
  <a
    href="/blog/2025-05-19-what-is-vsm/"
    data-carousel-item="blog"
    data-track-resource="blog"
    class="snap-start flex-shrink-0 w-[85vw] md:w-[calc(33.333%-1rem)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-white/10 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 transition-all group"
  >
    <img src="/images/workshops/image3.jpg" alt="What is Value Stream Mapping?" class="w-full h-48 object-cover" />
    <div class="p-5">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[rgb(67,97,238)] mb-2">Article</p>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-[rgb(67,97,238)] transition-colors">What is Value Stream Mapping?</h3>
      <p class="text-white/70 text-sm mb-4">VSM helps teams achieve a specific business outcome by improving work processes. Teams visualize the flow of work, identify inefficiencies, and create a roadmap of measurable improvements.</p>
      <span class="text-[rgb(67,97,238)] font-medium text-sm">Read article &rarr;</span>
    </div>
  </a>

  <!-- 2. YouTube Short: Workshop Overview -->
  <a
    href="https://www.youtube.com/shorts/FGXKSSGeUX4"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    data-carousel-item="short"
    data-track-resource="short"
    class="snap-start flex-shrink-0 w-[85vw] md:w-[calc(33.333%-1rem)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-white/10 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 transition-all group"
  >
    <div class="relative w-full h-48 overflow-hidden">
      <img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/FGXKSSGeUX4/hqdefault.jpg" alt="VSM Workshop Overview" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/30">
        <svg class="w-14 h-14 text-white/90" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="p-5">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[rgb(67,97,238)] mb-2">Video &middot; 1 min</p>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-[rgb(67,97,238)] transition-colors">Value Stream Mapping Workshop Overview</h3>
      <p class="text-white/70 text-sm mb-4">A quick walkthrough of what happens in a Value Stream Mapping workshop and the outcomes teams can expect.</p>
      <span class="text-[rgb(67,97,238)] font-medium text-sm">Watch &rarr;</span>
    </div>
  </a>

  <!-- 3. YouTube: Full Workshop Recording -->
  <a
    href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kii61nkkqfY"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    data-carousel-item="talk"
    data-track-resource="talk"
    class="snap-start flex-shrink-0 w-[85vw] md:w-[calc(33.333%-1rem)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-white/10 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 transition-all group"
  >
    <div class="relative w-full h-48 overflow-hidden">
      <img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/kii61nkkqfY/hqdefault.jpg" alt="VSM Workshop Talk" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/30">
        <svg class="w-14 h-14 text-white/90" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="p-5">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[rgb(67,97,238)] mb-2">Talk &middot; 33 min</p>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-[rgb(67,97,238)] transition-colors">How to Map the Value Stream to Deliver Software 2x Faster</h3>
      <p class="text-white/70 text-sm mb-4">Erica Engelen and I break down how to map the value stream to deliver software 2x faster while maintaining quality.</p>
      <span class="text-[rgb(67,97,238)] font-medium text-sm">Watch &rarr;</span>
    </div>
  </a>
</div>

<style>
  .scrollbar-hide::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
  .scrollbar-hide { -ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none; }
</style>
